## ✨ Why AniTool?

| **Before** | **With AniTool by Gab** |
|---|---|
| 7 apps for hex / patch / deobfuscate | **One app, 34 tools** — offline |
| Laggy, crashes on big files | **120fps** + native C++ + 5MB safe limit |
| Manual string search | **Auto-scan** + highlight |
| Copy-paste Frida scripts | **One-tap Hook** (Frida + LD_PRELOAD) |

---

## 🎯 <a id="features"></a>Features — 34 Tools

### 🔍 Binary Analysis
| Tool | Auto |
|---|---|
| **Hex Viewer** — hex + ASCII, edit | ✅ |
| **Strings** — real-time search | ✅ |
| **Disassembler** — ARM32/ARM64/x86 (Capstone) | ✅ Auto arch |
| **ELF Info** — headers/sections/symbols | ✅ |
| **APK Info** — DEX/libs/manifest | ✅ |

### 🛡️ Patching
| Tool | Auto |
|---|---|
| **Patch Editor** — single + bulk | ✅ |
| **Adv. Patch** — NOP/RET/String | ✅ Auto-scan |
| **Deobfuscate** — Base64/Hex/XOR/URL | ✅ Auto-scan |
| **Shell Script** — parse `.sh` → URLs | ✅ |
| **Shell Patcher** — edit URLs in `.sh` | ✅ |

### 🪝 Hooking
| Tool | Auto |
|---|---|
| **Frida Hook** — generate JS | ✅ |
| **Hook Generator** — LD_PRELOAD + trampoline | ✅ |
| **Anti-Debug** — TracerPid/ptrace | ✅ |

### 🧰 Utils
Hash • KeyGen • Base64/Hex • Diff • Manifest Reader • Bookmarks • Export Report • Recent Files • Memory Analyzer • Logcat • ELF Symbols • Search • Memory Dump • Lua Analyzer • Pak Archive • Terminal • Hex Copy

