## 💡 What's Next for AniTool

1. **AI Script Explainer** — on-device LLM explains obfuscated `.sh`/`.lua`
2. **Visual Patch Diff** — Git-like hex diff with colors
3. **APK Diff Pro** — compare two APKs (permissions, libs, DEX)
4. **Hook Marketplace (Local)** — save/tag/share hooks offline
5. **Patch Share via QR** — export `.anipatch` JSON

> Want it? [Open an issue](https://github.com/gabcodingapp-dev/AniTool/issues)

