## 🏗️ <a id="build"></a>Build on GitHub (Auto)

Every push → **Build APK** → `AniTool-debug` + `AniTool-release` in Artifacts (30 days). Tag `v*` → auto Release.

```bash
git clone https://github.com/gabcodingapp-dev/AniTool.git
cd AniTool
./gradlew assembleDebug
# → app/build/outputs/apk/debug/app-debug.apk
```

